+          "exact_statement": "In this normalization the superconformal algebra gives the nonnegative operator $$\\delta=2\\{S,Q\\}=E-2J_1-\\frac32R.$$",
+          "relevant_hypotheses_and_conventions": "Unit-S3 radial quantization, selected supercharge and radial Hilbert adjoint, the fixed N=1 subalgebra, and the stated superconformal-index normalization.",
+          "supplier_proof_status": "Current Step 1 decision is ready and hash-current. The definition records the source-reported algebra interface and makes no SCFT continuum-existence claim.",
