+          "claim": "For a gauge transformation $U\\in SU(2)$, $(UZU^{-1})^2=UZ^2U^{-1}$. For finite matrices, $\\operatorname{Tr}_2(AB)=\\sum_{i,j}A_{ij}B_{ji}=\\sum_{i,j}B_{ji}A_{ij}=\\operatorname{Tr}_2(BA)$, so $\\operatorname{Tr}_2(UZ^2U^{-1})=\\operatorname{Tr}_2(Z^2U^{-1}U)=\\operatorname{Tr}_2(Z^2)$. Under an $R$ rotation by $\\alpha$, $Z\\mapsto e^{2i\\alpha/3}Z$, hence $Z^2\\mapsto e^{4i\\alpha/3}Z^2$ and the linear trace has charge $4/3$.",
