+          "exact_statement": "In the $\\mathfrak{su}(2)$ center-charge sector define $\\mathcal C=\\mathbb Z_2\\times\\mathbb Z_2$ with charge $(e,m)$ and mutual-locality pairing $$\\langle(e,m),(e',m')\\rangle=em'-me'\\pmod2.$$",
