+---
+id: ex-qftx-scft-index-two-state-pair
+kind: example
+title: A Finite Boson–Fermion Pair in a Superconformal-Index Trace
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
